      "cooked": "<p>Has anyone tried this out before? &nbsp;It struck me on my drive in to work this morning that if you matched two non-support heros togather, and just made the \"villian\" references on the hero cards apply to the opposing hero, you could have an x-man style beatdown! &nbsp;</p><p>I THINK enviroments might be able to work too now that I think about it. &nbsp;This will require playtesting.&nbsp;</p>",
